---
// Pinterest Git Clone Optimization & Commit-Graph Diagram
---

<figure class="pt-diagram" aria-labelledby="pt-caption">
  <svg
    class="pt-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="pt-title pt-desc"
  >
    <title id="pt-title">
      Pinterest 一行 refspec 縮短 99% Clone 時間，與 Commit-Graph 等 Git 機制
    </title>
    <desc id="pt-desc">
      前兩欄是 Pinterest 2020 年的案例：Pinboard monorepo 的 Checkout 沒設
      refspec、抓了 2,500 多個分支，加上只抓 master 的 refspec 後 clone 從 40
      分鐘降到 30 秒。後兩欄是通用的 Git 機制：Commit-Graph 與
      Blobless、Treeless、Shallow Clone，不屬於 Pinterest 的案例。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="pt-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="pt-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Pinterest bottleneck (2020) -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(20, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">THE BOTTLENECK</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Pinboard 的瓶頸</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >2020 年的規模</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 350K+ Commits 歷史</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 2,500+ 個分支</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 完整 clone 約 20GB</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >Checkout 抓全部分支</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 沒設 refspec</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 預設抓 refs/heads/*</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• Clone 步驟約 40 分鐘</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >CI 頻繁 clone</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 工作日 6 萬次以上 pull</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 已設 depth 50、不抓 tags</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Pinterest one-line fix -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(255, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">THE ONE LINE</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Pinterest 的一行修正</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >加上 refspec</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Jenkins Checkout 階段</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• 只抓 master 分支</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 不再抓 2,500+ 個分支</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Clone 40m ➔ 30s</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• Clone 時間減少 99%</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 約 80 倍（作者推算）</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 建置時間顯著縮短</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >來源</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Pinterest Engineering</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 2020-10-23 部落格文章</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Commit-Graph (general Git, not Pinterest) -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(490, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">GIT MECHANISM</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Commit-Graph（通用）</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Generation Numbers</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Git 2.19 起計算拓撲層級</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 可達性查詢 (Reachability)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 依序號剪枝，少走 commit</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >二進位結構表 (.git/objects)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• OID Fanout 快速索引</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58">• OID Lookup 二分搜尋</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• CDAT 直接讀 Parent</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >fetch 時自動寫入</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• fetch.writeCommitGraph=true</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 下載 pack 後增量更新</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 4: Clone strategy (general Git, not Pinterest) -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(725, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">CLONE STRATEGY</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Clone 策略（通用）</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >Blobless Clone (本機)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --filter=blob:none</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 拉取完整 Commit 與 Tree</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• checkout 時才下載檔案</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Treeless Clone (CI 特化)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --filter=tree:0</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 連歷史目錄樹都不下載</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 適合用完即丟的 CI</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Shallow Clone (淺層)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --depth=1</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 宜搭配 --single-branch</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connectors / Flow Lines -->
    <path
      d="M 235 155 L 255 155"
      class="pt-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 705 155 L 725 155"
      class="pt-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <svg
    class="pt-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 320 620"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="pt-m-title"
  >
    <title id="pt-m-title">
      Pinterest 一行 refspec 與 Git 機制（手機檢視）
    </title>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 10)">
      <rect width="300" height="130" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >1. Pinterest 的瓶頸（2020）</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Pinboard：350K+ Commits、完整 20GB</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Checkout 沒設 refspec，抓全部分支</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• 2,500 多個分支，clone 約 40 分鐘</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 工作日 6 萬次以上 git pull</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 155)">
      <rect width="300" height="135" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >2. 一行修正：refspec 只抓 master</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• 原本已設 shallow、depth 50、不抓 tags</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• 加上 refspec，只抓 master</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• Clone 從 40 分鐘降到 30 秒（-99%）</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105">• 約 80 倍（作者推算）</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 305)">
      <rect width="300" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >3. Commit-Graph（通用 Git 機制）</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Git 2.19 起存 generation number</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• 依序號剪枝，減少走訪的 commit</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• 二進位結構表直讀，免解析 Commit 物件</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• fetch.writeCommitGraph=true</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 460)">
      <rect width="300" height="145" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >4. Clone 策略（通用 Git 機制）</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Blobless (--filter=blob:none)：按需拉檔案</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Treeless (--filter=tree:0)：一次性 CI</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• Shallow (--depth=1)：僅拉最新層狀態</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• Shallow 宜搭配 --single-branch</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <figcaption id="pt-caption" class="pt-diagram__caption">
    圖 1：Pinterest 用一行 refspec 把 Pinboard clone 從 40 分鐘降到 30
    秒；右兩欄是通用的 Commit-Graph 與 Clone 策略
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .pt-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pt-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 960px;
    font-family:
      -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue",
      Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .pt-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
  }

  .pt-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .pt-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Theme variables */
  .pt-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .pt-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .pt-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard {
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__header {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #0f766e;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #b45309;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .pt-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .pt-diagram__line {
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }

  .pt-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pt-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }
    .pt-diagram__mobile {
      display: block;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
